  "summary": {
    "title": "",
    "icon": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<ul><li><p>10+ years building and evolving .NET distributed systems — from greenfield design to modernizing legacy platforms carrying millions of transactions. Operate at the intersection of hands-on engineering and technical leadership.</p></li><li><p>Established architectural foundations at scale: authored RFCs and coding standards adopted across multiple squads, led a .NET 8 / ECS migration resolving 5+ years of debt, and designed event-driven multi-tenant systems on AWS (EventBridge, SQS, SNS, Lambda, DynamoDB).</p></li><li><p>Drive measurable outcomes: reduced API latency 4x (8s → 2s) on a 150K tpd platform, grew traffic 20% via a frontend rewrite, and lifted team velocity 40% through LLM-assisted development workflows — without compromising 80%+ test coverage.</p></li><li><p>Experienced in high-compliance environments (SOC2), production incident response, and mentoring engineers toward senior-level thinking.</p></li></ul><p></p>"
  },
