          "position": "Senior Software Engineer",
          "location": "Remote",
          "period": "March 2023 - Present",
          "website": {
            "url": "https://domain.com.au",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": true
          },
          "description": "<ul><li><p>Wrote the team's first RFCs and coding standards from scratch; the architectural patterns are still in use 2+ years later across multiple squads.</p></li><li><p>Owned the modernization roadmap for mission-critical services, migrating from .NET Framework 4.6 on AWS EC2 (Windows) to .NET 8 on Amazon ECS (Linux containers) to resolve 5+ years of technical debt and eliminate OS licensing overhead.</p></li><li><p>Designed a multi-tenant Pricing &amp; Billing Engine with Event Sourcing on AWS (EventBridge, SQS, SNS) and guided the team through adopting event-driven architecture.</p></li><li><p>Ran production incident response and post-mortems; built deadlock simulations and observability tooling to catch issues before they reached customers.</p></li><li><p>Reworked order dispatching and subscription logic for agency-level listing plans to handle growing data volumes without degradation.</p></li><li><p>Brought LLM-assisted code reviews and automated test generation into the development workflow (Copilot, Gemini), keeping 80% test coverage while boosting team output by 40%.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
          "roles": []
        },
        {
          "id": "019d03ac-ed42-7443-944e-b220029a12bb",
          "hidden": false,
          "company": "Carsales (carsales.com.au)",
          "position": "Senior Software Engineer",
          "location": "Remote",
          "period": "November 2021 – March 2023",
          "website": {
            "url": "https://carsales.com.au",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": true
          },
          "description": "<ul><li><p>Broke apart a monolithic Editorial API into separate read (Research Data API with distributed caching) and write paths (MS SQL CMS), consumed by multiple teams across the org.</p></li><li><p>Led the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://Redbook.com.au\">Redbook.com.au</a> frontend rewrite — replaced legacy pages with responsive interfaces, driving a 20% traffic increase.</p></li><li><p>Shipped the \"Can't Find Your Car\" feature end-to-end, generating 200+ new ad listings within 90 days of launch.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
          "roles": []
        },
        {
